24868,"HSBC Bank Important Information
Dear HSBC Bank Customer, Due to concerns, for the safety and integrity of the HSBC Bank account we have issued this warning message. It has come to our attention that your HSBC Bank account information needs to be updated as part of our continuing commitment to protect your account in this new year 2010 and to reduce the instance of fraud on our website. If you could please take 5-10 minutes out of your online experience and update your personal records you will not run into any future problems with the online service. Once you have updated your account records your HSBC Bank account service will not be interrupted and will continue as normal. To update your HSBC Bank records click on the following link: http://www.hsbc.co.uk/1/2/personal/internet-banking <Agreement if you have any questions. http://www.abouthsbc.co.uk/, Thank You. Accounts Management As outlined in our User Agreement, HSBC Bank will periodically send you information about site changes and enhancements. Visit our Privacy Policy and User",i06,Contact and Conversation,"GENERAL SETTINGS
